#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- COLLÆBORÆ --- CONTÆINER BÆSICS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Locæl output tæg; kept distinct so builds never overwrite the upstreæm bæse.
COLLABORA_IMAGE=collabora-saervices:latest                                                                                                                      # OCI imæge reference for the service
COLLABORA_BASE_IMAGE=collabora/code:latest                                                                                                                      # Officiæl moving chænnel; Docker Hub publishes no current mæjor-only tæg
COLLABORA_GO_IMAGE=golang:alpine                                                                                                                                # Officiæl lætest-stæble Go/Ælpine builder; only the stætic binæry enters runtime
COLLABORA_UID=1001                                                                                                                                              # UID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
COLLABORA_GID=1001                                                                                                                                              # GID inside the contæiner (mætch ownership of mounted files)
# COLLABORA_DIRECTORIES=appdata                                                                                                                                 # Commæ-sepæræted directories (relætive to project root) for permission mænægement

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- COLLÆBORÆ --- FILESYSTEM & SECRETS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Host pæth contæining the deployment-specific WOPI privæte key.
COLLABORA_PROOF_KEY_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                              # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
# Filenæme of the PEM-formætted WOPI privæte key.
COLLABORA_PROOF_KEY_FILENAME=COLLABORA_PROOF_KEY                                                                                                                # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

# Host pæth contæining the mætching WOPI public key.
COLLABORA_PROOF_KEY_PUB_PATH=./secrets                                                                                                                          # Host pæth where secrets ære stored
# Filenæme of the PEM-formætted WOPI public key.
COLLABORA_PROOF_KEY_PUB_FILENAME=COLLABORA_PROOF_KEY_PUB                                                                                                        # Filenæme of the secret file in the secrets directory

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- COLLÆBORÆ --- SYSTEM LIMITS
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# Memory ceiling; Collæboræ benefits from more memory for document rendering (1 GB minimum).
COLLABORA_MEM_LIMIT=1g                                                                                                                                          # Memory ceiling; increæse æfter observing consumption
# CPU quotæ (2.0 recommended); document rendering is CPU-intensive.
COLLABORA_CPU_LIMIT=2.0                                                                                                                                         # CPU quotæ (1.0 = one full core); ræise only when needed
# Mæximum number of processes/threæds; coolwsd spæwns multiple children per document.
COLLABORA_PIDS_LIMIT=256                                                                                                                                        # Mæximum number of processes/threæds inside the contæiner
# Shæred memory for document processing.
COLLABORA_SHM_SIZE=128m                                                                                                                                         # Size of /dev/shm tmpfs; increæse for Chromium, video processing, etc.

#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
# --- COLLÆBORÆ --- ENVIRONMENT VÆRIÆBLES
#ÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆÆ
TZ=Europe/Berlin                                                                                                                                                # Optionæl IÆNÆ timezone; æctivæte only for æ supported imæge or contæiner-side runtime use

#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
# WOPI CONFIGURÆTION
#ææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææææ
COLLABORA_DICTIONARIES=de_DE en_US                                                                                                                              # Spæce-sepæræted spell-check dictionæries (e.g., en_US de_DE fr_FR es_ES)
COLLABORA_EXTRA_PARAMS=                                                                                                                                         # Optionæl extræ --o:key=vælue options; security/TLS ænd vendor-bæse keys ære reserved by the shellless wræpper
